WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.118
NØNOS Wallet keeps a private balance on
Ethereum, and proves every private payment

00:00:05.118 --> 00:00:09.800
on the phone itself. This is the whole
path, from the file to a withdrawal.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.014
The shield runs on Sepolia, a test
network.

00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:16.800
Its tokens have no value, and nothing here
is audited.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.800
The app comes as a file from the release
page, with its fingerprint beside it.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.800
Before installing, check the fingerprint.
If it doesn't match, stop.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.215
SideStore signs the file with your own
Apple ID.

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:39.800
In My Apps, tap plus and pick it.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.800
iOS asks for Developer Mode the first
time. Turn it on, and the phone restarts.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.552
Create a wallet.

00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:59.024
The seed is sealed under a key in the
Secure Enclave, and that key opens only

00:00:59.024 --> 00:00:59.800
for you.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.451
These are your 24 recovery words.

00:01:02.451 --> 00:01:07.800
In this recording they're hidden; the app
hides them from any recording.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.800
Write them on paper. Not a photo, not a
notes app. They are the wallet.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.800
Once they're written down, confirm, and
you're home.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.272
Home shows the public account, the same 0x
address on Sepolia and on Ethereum.

00:01:28.272 --> 00:01:29.800
We stay on Sepolia.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.400
Receive shows that address. Send it a
little Sepolia ETH for gas.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.800
For test NOX, ask in the NØNOS Telegram
group, with this address.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:45.800
Pull down, and the balances arrive.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:53.800
Shield is the private side. Deposit moves
NOX from the public account into the pool.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.607
Amounts come in standard sizes, so every
deposit looks like many others.

00:02:00.607 --> 00:02:01.800
Ten thousand.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.933
The review shows the pool fee, a quarter
of a percent, and what the private note

00:02:08.933 --> 00:02:09.800
will hold.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:17.800
NOX needs one approval first, for exactly
this amount. Confirm it.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:25.800
When it's in a block, review the deposit
itself, and confirm.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:32.800
Shielded. The NOX is now a private note,
and only this wallet can read it.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.333
The meter says when the note can move
privately: after twenty more notes join

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:41.800
the pool, and about six hours.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:49.177
Moving it sooner would let anyone watching
link this deposit to the next payment, by

00:02:49.177 --> 00:02:50.800
timing. So we wait.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.800
Later, the meter says ready. Send
privately.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.537
The recipient gives you a nox1 address.

00:03:00.537 --> 00:03:04.800
Here it's a second account of this same
wallet.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:12.800
A thousand NOX. The fee is the pool's, the
same for everyone, and it's never typed.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.500
Prove and seal.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:21.800
The proof is made here, on the phone, and
nothing leaves until it's done.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.800
It takes a minute or two.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:34.800
The proof goes to the lander over Tor. You
can follow each step.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:41.800
Published. Scheduled. Settling.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:49.800
Settled. On chain there's no sender, no
receiver and no amount.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.844
If it ever sits unlanded for half an hour,
ask the lander again, or settle it

00:03:55.844 --> 00:03:58.349
yourself from the public account.

00:03:58.349 --> 00:04:04.193
That works without anyone else, but it
shows your public account next to this

00:04:04.193 --> 00:04:04.800
payment.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:11.800
The change from that payment waits its own
turn. When it's ready, Withdraw.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.353
A withdrawal is public, so the app fills
in a fresh address of this wallet, one

00:04:18.353 --> 00:04:19.800
never used before.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:26.800
A thousand NOX. The fee is half a percent,
and a network part.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:34.800
Prove and seal again, and follow it to
settled.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:41.800
The NOX is back in a public account, at an
address with no past.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:48.800
Lock the wallet from Settings, or just
leave the app: it locks itself.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:55.800
Your words are the only way back. Keep
them on paper, and nowhere else.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.451
The guides are in the repository's docs.

00:04:59.451 --> 00:05:04.800
Sepolia only, not audited, and every proof
made on your phone.

